# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every
# platform. Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites every
# line ending to CRLF and prettier/eslint then flags every line. Keeping the
# working tree LF everywhere means `npm run lint` behaves the same on Windows,
# macOS (Flutter dev), and CI (Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated files: keep LF, but hide from diffs and mark as generated.
bun.lock            -diff linguist-generated
src/routeTree.gen.ts -diff linguist-generated

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never diff.
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary
